  "storylets": [
    {
      "id": "B-JUN-LOCKED0",
      "char": "CH-JUN",
      "topic": "locked_room",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Bolted from the inside, they say. Have you looked at that door yet, sir?",
          "direction": "brisk, practical",
          "id": "L-JUN-LOCKED0-1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-JUN-LOCKED",
      "char": "CH-JUN",
      "topic": "locked_room",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Bolt thrown from inside, and the only window painted shut since the old King died.",
          "direction": "thinking aloud",
          "id": "L-JUN-LOCKED-1"
        },
        {
          "text": "Hang on. My gran was in service here before the war. She used to send his supper up in a box on a rope. There's a dumbwaiter behind that study panelling, sir. It runs down to the pantry.",
          "direction": "suddenly certain",
          "inline": [
            {
              "before_word": "dumbwaiter",
              "direction": "leaning in"
            }
          ],
          "id": "L-JUN-LOCKED-2"
        }
      ],
      "requires": {
        "cards_seen_all": [
          "E-BOLT"
        ]
      },
      "once": true,
      "priority": 10,
      "sets_flags": [
        "BOTTLENECK_1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-JUN-HINT0",
      "char": "CH-JUN",
      "topic": "*",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Start with the room itself, sir. The door, the mantel, that tray.",
          "direction": "quiet, steady",
          "id": "L-JUN-HINT0-1"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "ASK",
        "FOLLOW_UP",
        "SMALL_TALK"
      ],
      "priority": -1,
      "requires": {
        "flags_none": [
          "BOTTLENECK_1"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "B-JUN-HINT1",
      "char": "CH-JUN",
      "topic": "*",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Somebody left that study without using the door. Ask them all where they were at twenty to eleven.",
          "direction": "low",
          "id": "L-JUN-HINT1-1"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "ASK",
        "FOLLOW_UP",
        "SMALL_TALK"
      ],
      "priority": -1,
      "requires": {
        "flags_all": [
          "BOTTLENECK_1"
        ],
        "flags_none": [
          "TOB_ALIBI"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "B-JUN-HINT2",
      "char": "CH-JUN",
      "topic": "*",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Mr Wren says he was typing. If he was, someone heard it, or the page in that machine shows it.",
          "direction": "dry",
          "id": "L-JUN-HINT2-1"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "ASK",
        "FOLLOW_UP",
        "SMALL_TALK"
      ],
      "priority": -1,
      "requires": {
        "flags_all": [
          "TOB_ALIBI"
        ],
        "flags_none": [
          "BOTTLENECK_2"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "B-JUN-HINT3",
      "char": "CH-JUN",
      "topic": "*",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "He lied about the library. A man doesn't lie for nothing. Ask about the maps, and have a proper look at the old man's desk.",
          "direction": "grim",
          "id": "L-JUN-HINT3-1"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "ASK",
        "FOLLOW_UP",
        "SMALL_TALK"
      ],
      "priority": -1,
      "requires": {
        "flags_all": [
          "BOTTLENECK_2"
        ],
        "flags_none": [
          "CH-TOB_LOCKS_OPEN"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "B-JUN-HINT4",
      "char": "CH-JUN",
      "topic": "*",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "That's the whole of it, sir: where he really was, why he did it, and what he left behind. Accuse when you're ready.",
          "direction": "certain",
          "id": "L-JUN-HINT4-1"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "ASK",
        "FOLLOW_UP",
        "SMALL_TALK"
      ],
      "priority": -1,
      "requires": {
        "flags_all": [
          "CH-TOB_LOCKS_OPEN"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "B-JUN-VICTIM",
      "char": "CH-JUN",
      "topic": "victim",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Edmund Grale. Fifty years collecting old maps. Hit once, from behind, with that brass bookend. He'd not have seen it coming.",
          "direction": "flat, professional",
          "id": "L-JUN-VICTIM-1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-JUN-CLOCK",
      "char": "CH-JUN",
      "topic": "*",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "One o'clock, sir. The coroner's van gets through at two, and then it's the county's case, not ours.",
          "direction": "checking her watch",
          "id": "L-JUN-CLOCK-1"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "SCHEDULED"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-JUN-LATE",
      "char": "CH-JUN",
      "topic": "*",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Half past one. Whatever we've got, we'd best decide soon.",
          "direction": "urgent, quiet",
          "id": "L-JUN-LATE-1"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "SCHEDULED"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-JUN-KEEP",
      "char": "CH-JUN",
      "topic": "*",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Then I never heard about any nephew in the stable loft. Right you are, sir.",
          "direction": "warm, conspiratorial",
          "id": "L-JUN-KEEP-1"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "SCHEDULED"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-JUN-REPORT",
      "char": "CH-JUN",
      "topic": "*",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I'll ring the barracks in the morning. She won't thank us for it, sir.",
          "direction": "subdued",
          "id": "L-JUN-REPORT-1"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "SCHEDULED"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-TOB-HELLO",
      "char": "CH-TOB",
      "topic": "*",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Inspector. A dreadful night. Anything I can do, of course.",
          "direction": "smooth, helpful",
          "id": "L-TOB-HELLO-1"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "SMALL_TALK"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-TOB-WHERE",
      "char": "CH-TOB",
      "topic": "whereabouts",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I was in the library, typing Mr Grale's correspondence, from ten o'clock until Hester came hammering on the study door.",
          "direction": "precise, rehearsed",
          "paired": [
            {
              "tag": "emphasis",
              "words": "typing"
            }
          ],
          "id": "L-TOB-WHERE-1"
        }
      ],
      "utters_claims": [
        "CL-TOB-LIB"
      ],
      "sets_flags": [
        "TOB_ALIBI"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-TOB-MAPS",
      "char": "CH-TOB",
      "topic": "maps",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Every map in this house is genuine. I catalogued them myself. I'd stake my name on it.",
          "direction": "proud, a touch too quick",
          "id": "L-TOB-MAPS-1"
        }
      ],
      "utters_claims": [
        "CL-TOB-MAPS"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-TOB-DUMB",
      "char": "CH-TOB",
      "topic": "dumbwaiter",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "That old thing? I haven't been near it since the war. I doubt it even runs.",
          "direction": "light, dismissive",
          "id": "L-TOB-DUMB-1"
        }
      ],
      "requires": {
        "flags_all": [
          "BOTTLENECK_1"
        ]
      },
      "utters_claims": [
        "CL-TOB-NEVER"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-TOB-VICTIM",
      "char": "CH-TOB",
      "topic": "victim",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Twelve years I worked for him. He could be hard. He was never unjust.",
          "direction": "measured, eyes down",
          "id": "L-TOB-VICTIM-1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-TOB-LOCKED",
      "char": "CH-TOB",
      "topic": "locked_room",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Hester and I broke the frame together. He was on the hearthrug. I'd rather not describe it.",
          "direction": "quiet",
          "id": "L-TOB-LOCKED-1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-TOB-PRESS",
      "char": "CH-TOB",
      "topic": "*",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I've given you my answer, Inspector. Twice now.",
          "direction": "clipped, touching his cuff",
          "id": "L-TOB-PRESS-1"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "PRESS",
        "THREATEN"
      ],
      "composure_delta": -8,
      "trust_delta": -5
    },
    {
      "id": "B-TOB-CORNERED",
      "char": "CH-TOB",
      "topic": "*",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "You've built your little case, haven't you. Then make your accusation. Properly.",
          "direction": "very still, cold",
          "id": "L-TOB-CORNERED-1"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "ASK",
        "PRESS",
        "DEMAND_CONFESSION",
        "FOLLOW_UP"
      ],
      "priority": 20,
      "requires": {
        "flags_all": [
          "CH-TOB_LOCKS_OPEN"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "B-TOB-CRACK-ALIBI",
      "char": "CH-TOB",
      "topic": "whereabouts",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "All right. I stepped out of the library. For air. A man may step out.",
          "direction": "a breath too long",
          "id": "L-TOB-CRACK-ALIBI-1"
        },
        {
          "text": "But I never went near that dumbwaiter, if that's what you're thinking.",
          "direction": "recovering, too firm",
          "id": "L-TOB-CRACK-ALIBI-2"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "PRESENT"
      ],
      "utters_claims": [
        "CL-TOB-NEVER"
      ],
      "sets_flags": [
        "BOTTLENECK_2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-TOB-CRACK-PHYS",
      "char": "CH-TOB",
      "topic": "dumbwaiter",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Grey wool. Ink. Half the county wears grey wool, Inspector.",
          "direction": "shaky, then a forced laugh",
          "id": "L-TOB-CRACK-PHYS-1"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "PRESENT"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-TOB-CRACK-MOTIVE",
      "char": "CH-TOB",
      "topic": "maps",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "A few bad maps. He'd have sent me to prison over a few bad maps. He never even needed the money.",
          "direction": "bitter, quiet",
          "inline": [
            {
              "before_word": "prison",
              "direction": "voice catching"
            }
          ],
          "id": "L-TOB-CRACK-MOTIVE-1"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "PRESENT"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-TOB-CONFESS",
      "char": "CH-TOB",
      "topic": "*",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "He'd written to the police. He showed me the letter, as if I'd thank him for the warning.",
          "direction": "cold and level",
          "id": "L-TOB-CONFESS-1"
        },
        {
          "text": "I picked up the bookend. I don't remember deciding to. Then the clock went over, and it was twenty to eleven.",
          "direction": "almost relieved",
          "id": "L-TOB-CONFESS-2"
        },
        {
          "text": "The dumbwaiter was the only way out. I bolted the door so it would look like his heart. Hester was right there in the pantry. She very nearly saw me.",
          "direction": "quietly, finished",
          "id": "L-TOB-CONFESS-3"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "ACCUSE"
      ],
      "requires": {
        "flags_all": [
          "CH-TOB_CONFESSES"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "B-IRI-HELLO",
      "char": "CH-IRI",
      "topic": "*",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I keep thinking he'll ring for his cocoa.",
          "direction": "brittle, trying to smile",
          "id": "L-IRI-HELLO-1"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "SMALL_TALK"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-IRI-WHERE",
      "char": "CH-IRI",
      "topic": "whereabouts",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "In the conservatory, from ten until I heard Hester shouting. I was potting the orchids he gave me. Ask the orchids.",
          "direction": "dry, tired",
          "id": "L-IRI-WHERE-1"
        }
      ],
      "utters_claims": [
        "CL-IRI-CONS"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-IRI-WILL",
      "char": "CH-IRI",
      "topic": "will",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Yes, I inherit. He told me at Christmas. I'd give it all back to have him grumbling at breakfast.",
          "direction": "sharp, then soft",
          "id": "L-IRI-WILL-1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-IRI-LIBRARY0",
      "char": "CH-IRI",
      "topic": "library",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "The library? That's Tobias's kingdom. I don't go in.",
          "direction": "indifferent",
          "id": "L-IRI-LIBRARY0-1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-IRI-LIBRARY",
      "char": "CH-IRI",
      "topic": "library",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I passed it at half ten, on my way for more compost. The door was ajar and the lamp was lit.",
          "direction": "remembering",
          "id": "L-IRI-QUIET"
        },
        {
          "text": "And it was silent. No typing at all. Nobody in there.",
          "direction": "realising",
          "paired": [
            {
              "tag": "emphasis",
              "words": "silent"
            }
          ],
          "id": "L-IRI-LIBRARY-2"
        }
      ],
      "requires": {
        "flags_all": [
          "TOB_ALIBI"
        ]
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "reveals": [
        "T-IRI-QUIET"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-IRI-MAPS0",
      "char": "CH-IRI",
      "topic": "maps",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Uncle's maps were his children. I never cared for them, which he forgave, mostly.",
          "direction": "fond",
          "id": "L-IRI-MAPS0-1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-IRI-DEALER",
      "char": "CH-IRI",
      "topic": "maps",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Now you say it. On Tuesday a letter came from a dealer in Edinburgh. Uncle went white, and he said 'Tobias' out loud, to nobody.",
          "direction": "slowly, frightened",
          "id": "L-IRI-DEALER"
        }
      ],
      "requires": {
        "flags_all": [
          "BOTTLENECK_2"
        ]
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "reveals": [
        "T-IRI-DEALER"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-IRI-VICTIM",
      "char": "CH-IRI",
      "topic": "victim",
      "mode": "writer",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "He was difficult and generous and he smelled of pipe smoke and old paper.",
          "direction": "grief held down",
          "id": "L-IRI-VICTIM-1"
        }
      ],
      "facts_allowed": [
        "Edmund Grale collected maps for fifty years",
        "Iris is his niece"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-IRI-PRESS",
      "char": "CH-IRI",
      "topic": "*",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Shout if you like, Inspector. I was among the ferns.",
          "direction": "cool contempt",
          "id": "L-IRI-PRESS-1"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "PRESS",
        "THREATEN"
      ],
      "composure_delta": -5,
      "trust_delta": -5
    },
    {
      "id": "B-IRI-TEA",
      "char": "CH-IRI",
      "topic": "tea",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Hester always takes him tea at half nine. Sometimes she sits with him. They're old friends.",
          "direction": "matter of fact",
          "id": "L-IRI-TEA-1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-HES-HELLO",
      "char": "CH-HES",
      "topic": "*",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I've put the kettle on, sir. It's all I know how to do tonight.",
          "direction": "shaky, kind",
          "id": "L-HES-HELLO-1"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "SMALL_TALK"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-HES-WHERE",
      "char": "CH-HES",
      "topic": "whereabouts",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "After his tea I was in my kitchen all evening, sir. Never left it, not till I went up to knock.",
          "direction": "too quick",
          "id": "L-HES-WHERE-1"
        }
      ],
      "utters_claims": [
        "CL-HES-KITCHEN"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-HES-TEA",
      "char": "CH-HES",
      "topic": "tea",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Two cups, yes. I sat with him at half past nine about my pension. He said I'd want for nothing. I left at a quarter to ten.",
          "direction": "tearful, honest",
          "id": "L-HES-TEA-1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-HES-PANTRY0",
      "char": "CH-HES",
      "topic": "dumbwaiter",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I don't know anything about that old lift, sir. Nothing at all.",
          "direction": "frightened, defensive",
          "id": "L-HES-PANTRY0-1"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "ASK",
        "FOLLOW_UP",
        "PRESS"
      ],
      "requires": {
        "flags_all": [
          "BOTTLENECK_1"
        ]
      },
      "composure_delta": -5
    },
    {
      "id": "B-HES-PANTRY",
      "char": "CH-HES",
      "topic": "*",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I wasn't in my kitchen the whole time. I took a plate out to the stable loft. My sister's boy is hiding up there from his call-up.",
          "direction": "whispering, ashamed",
          "id": "L-HES-PANTRY"
        },
        {
          "text": "Coming back up the back stairs, at ten to eleven, I saw Mr Wren come out of the pantry. Brushing his sleeve, he was.",
          "direction": "steadier",
          "id": "L-HES-PANTRY-2"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "REASSURE"
      ],
      "requires": {
        "flags_all": [
          "BOTTLENECK_1"
        ]
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "once": true,
      "reveals": [
        "T-HES-PANTRY"
      ],
      "trust_delta": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "B-HES-REASSURE0",
      "char": "CH-HES",
      "topic": "*",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "You're kind, sir. But there's nothing to tell.",
          "direction": "softening",
          "id": "L-HES-REASSURE0-1"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "REASSURE"
      ],
      "trust_delta": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "B-HES-VICTIM",
      "char": "CH-HES",
      "topic": "victim",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Forty years I kept house for him. He was a good master. Particular. Good.",
          "direction": "breaking a little",
          "id": "L-HES-VICTIM-1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-HES-LOCKED",
      "char": "CH-HES",
      "topic": "locked_room",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I knocked and knocked. Mr Wren came running from the library end, and we put our shoulders to it.",
          "direction": "shaky",
          "id": "L-HES-LOCKED-1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-END-TRUE",
      "char": "CH-JUN",
      "topic": "*",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Tobias Wren, I'm arresting you for the murder of Edmund Grale. Mind the step, sir. It's slippery.",
          "direction": "quiet, final",
          "id": "L-END-TRUE-1"
        },
        {
          "text": "Nicely done, Inspector. The van's at the gate.",
          "direction": "relieved",
          "id": "L-END-TRUE-2"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "ACCUSE"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-END-HALF",
      "char": "CH-JUN",
      "topic": "*",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "You've the right man, sir, but that story won't stand up. His solicitor will have him home by Friday.",
          "direction": "worried",
          "id": "L-END-HALF-1"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "ACCUSE"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-END-IRIS",
      "char": "CH-JUN",
      "topic": "*",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Miss Grale? She was in the conservatory, sir. And the real one's watching us take her.",
          "direction": "uneasy",
          "id": "L-END-IRIS-1"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "ACCUSE"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-END-HESTER",
      "char": "CH-JUN",
      "topic": "*",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Hester? Forty years in this house, sir, and her only crime's a plate of supper for a frightened boy.",
          "direction": "dismayed",
          "id": "L-END-HESTER-1"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "ACCUSE"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B-END-DAWN",
      "char": "CH-JUN",
      "topic": "*",
      "mode": "authored",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "That's the van, sir. It's the county's case now. And whoever did it slept in their own bed tonight.",
          "direction": "flat, tired",
          "id": "L-END-DAWN-1"
        }
      ],
      "intents": [
        "SCHEDULED"
      ]
    }
  ],
